  </div>
</div>
</p>

{% if fig_dmp_scatter %}<p class="name_fig" style="font-weight: bold; text-align: center;">Figure {{fig_dmp_scatter}} Scatter Plot</p>{% endif %}
<p class="premark">Note: The X-axis and Y-axis represent the average beta values of the two groups, respectively. Red points in the plot indicate sites with Δβ differences, while green points represent sites without differences.</p>
<p class="premark">Result file path: See the .png/.pdf files under 2.DMP/*vs*/DMP_Scatter_plot.png/pdf in the Result directory.</p>


<hr/>
<a name="Heatmap"></a>
{% if subsection_dmp_heatmap %}<h4>{{subsection_dmp_heatmap}}　Heatmap</h4>{% endif %}
<p class="paragraph">
A total of 5,000 DMPs were randomly selected for plotting; if fewer than 5,000 DMPs were identified, all available DMPs were plotted.
</p>

<p class="center">
<div class="row gallery-row">
  <div class="col-1">
    <div id="gallery_figure_heatmap_button_prev" class="button_prev" onclick="prev(this.id)">
      <svg viewbox="0 0 16000 16000" class="svg_prev">
